      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I would like Avatar sorting for this reason. Filters and faster avatar preview load times. We've loaded them before, shouldn't they still be in cache?\n\nAtop this, why is it that I have to 'Avatar' menu sets? Every second time I go to my Avatar list, it shows me my first avatar/s, but otherwise it shows my most recent?\nI think these could be fixed by simply adding folders and being able to section each avatar off with criteria.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
